{"id":"wb-6-649","name":"河南府文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"河南府文庙","text":"河南府文庙位于中华人民共和国河南省洛阳市老城区东南隅文明街，历史上为供奉祭奠孔子的庙宇，同时也是河南府府学。2006年被公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n洛阳在历史上曾同时为河南府的府治和洛阳县的县治，因此同时设有府、县两级文庙。洛阳县文庙位于东关大街，建筑毁于民国时期，仅存孔子入周问礼碑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%BA%9C%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":91950599,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91950599","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/58d19097b6b1fbd515bdfe70.jpg","title":"20241215_Henan_Fu_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241215_Henan_Fu_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/20241215_Henan_Fu_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Henan Fu Confucian Temple under repairment.","width":320,"height":213}}